# T-1618: Annotation::Annotated with a PropertyDict as outer — chained annotation.
# x@[doc: "help"]@Inner in dict key position uses
# Annotated(Box<Annotation>, Box<Annotation>) with a non-Simple outer.
# The PropertyDict in the outer position produces Value::Annotated wrapping,
# so annotation-of returns the annotation dict.
[
  x@[doc: "help"]@Inner: 42
  ann: [annotation-of x]
  result: [= ann.doc "help"]
]
=== out
Dict({"x": Annotated(Int(42), {"doc": String("help")}), "ann": Dict({"doc": String("help")}), "result": Variant(Boolean.True, Null)})
